      "content": "rebuilding feels like a joke. why would i want to rebuild a version of myself that he isn't part of? it doesn't feel like a new beginning, it just feels like a life sentence of being alone in a shell. i just feel so disconnected from everything. like i don't even belong in this world anymore without him.",
